    "pl": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"catalog wrap\">\n<aside class=\"catalog-sidebar\"><nav class=\"catalog-portfolio-menu\" aria-label=\"Portfolio wydawnictwa\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GRY I PUBLIKACJE</span><a href=\"#elekt\">Elekt</a><a href=\"#tsukuyumi\">Tsukuyumi</a><a href=\"#kurzolaki\">Kurzołaki</a><a href=\"#klanarchia\">Klanarchia</a><span class=\"catalog-menu-divider\"></span><a href=\"#catalog-echo\">Echo Światów</a><a href=\"#catalog-comic\">Komiks Tsukuyumi</a></nav></aside><div class=\"catalog-content\">\n<section id=\"elekt\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=pl\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/elekt.jpg\" alt=\"Elekt\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">GRA KARCIANA / 1–4 GRACZY</span><h2>Elekt</h2><p>Taktyczna gra karciana o walce o władzę. Przywołuj sługi, rozwijaj ich moce i przejmuj wpływy.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Poznaj grę</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side elekt-expansions\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WIĘCEJ ELEKTA</span><h3>Dodatki do Elekta</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=pl#elekt-expansions\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/elekt-dodatki.png\" alt=\"Dodatki do Elekta\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Dodatki do Elekta</span></a><p>Nowe karty, zdolności i kombinacje. Poznaj dodatki i wybierz, jak rozbudować swoją talię.</p><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=pl#elekt-expansions\">Poznaj dodatki</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"tsukuyumi\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature catalog-feature-box\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsukuyumi.png\" alt=\"Tsukuyumi: Full Moon Down\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">STRATEGIA / ASYMETRYCZNE FRAKCJE</span><h2>Tsukuyumi</h2><p>Wybierz armię w świecie po upadku Księżyca. Każda frakcja walczy inaczej — o wyniku decydują Twoje decyzje.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Poznaj grę</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ROZBUDUJ SWÓJ ŚWIAT</span><h3>Sunrise Kingdom</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl#tsu-sunrise\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsu-Tsukuyumi-SunriseKingdom-300x285.jpg\" alt=\"Sunrise Kingdom\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><p>Pięć nowych frakcji, Bramy i Dary Amaterasu. Duże rozszerzenie gry Full Moon Down.</p><div class=\"catalog-related\"><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl#tsu-factions\">Wszystkie frakcje</a><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl#tsu-expansions\">Nowe Lądy i Gracz+</a></div><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl#tsu-sunrise\">Poznaj dodatki</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"kurzolaki\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=pl\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/kurzolaki.jpg\" alt=\"Kurzołaki\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">GRA PLANSZOWA</span><h2>Kurzołaki</h2><p>Flejtuchy, Robale i kostka mydła walczą pod łóżkiem o landrynkę. Każda strona ma własne zdolności i cel.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Poznaj grę</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DODATEK DO KURZOŁAKÓW</span><h3>Sweet Revenge</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=pl#dust-expansion\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/kurzolaki-sweet-revenge.jpg\" alt=\"Sweet Revenge\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><p>Tym razem stań po stronie Landrynki. Dowódź Okruszkami i Żelkami — słodka zdobycz potrafi się bronić.</p><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=pl#dust-expansion\">Poznaj dodatki</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"klanarchia\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"https://whatthefrog.pl/klanarchia/\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/klanarchia.jpg\" alt=\"Klanarchia\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">GRA FABULARNA</span><h2>Klanarchia</h2><p>Opowiedz własną historię w świecie mrocznej techno-mistyki.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Poznaj grę</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side catalog-side-empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></aside></section>\n<section id=\"publications\" class=\"catalog-publications\"><header><span class=\"eyebrow\">PUBLIKACJE</span><h2>Światy poza planszą.</h2><p>Ilustracje, opowieści i muzyka. Inny sposób na zanurzenie się w wyobraźni.</p></header><article id=\"catalog-echo\" class=\"publication publication-echo\"><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=pl\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Echo-Swiatow-2.jpg\" alt=\"Artbook Echo Światów i płyta CD\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"publication-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ARTBOOK + PŁYTA CD</span><h3><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=pl\">Echo Światów</a></h3><p>Album ilustracji i muzyki skomponowanej do obrazów. W środku również opowiadania i inspiracje do sesji RPG. Do słuchania, oglądania i tworzenia własnych historii.</p><label class=\"catalog-audio-label\" for=\"catalog-echo-audio\">Posłuchaj: Wiedźmy</label><audio id=\"catalog-echo-audio\" controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Elekt-Witches.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio><a class=\"catalog-cta\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=pl\">Poznaj album</a></div></article><a id=\"catalog-comic\" class=\"publication publication-comic\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=pl\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsukuyumi-komiks.png\" alt=\"Komiks Tsukuyumi\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">KOMIKS</span><h3>Tsukuyumi</h3><p>Historia upadku Ziemi i jej frakcji.</p></a></section>\n</div></main>",
    "en": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"catalog wrap\">\n<aside class=\"catalog-sidebar\"><nav class=\"catalog-portfolio-menu\" aria-label=\"Publisher portfolio\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GAMES &amp; PUBLICATIONS</span><a href=\"#elekt\">Elekt</a><a href=\"#tsukuyumi\">Tsukuyumi</a><a href=\"#kurzolaki\">Dustlings</a><a href=\"#klanarchia\">Clanarchy</a><span class=\"catalog-menu-divider\"></span><a href=\"#catalog-echo\">Echo of Worlds</a><a href=\"#catalog-comic\">Tsukuyumi comic</a></nav></aside><div class=\"catalog-content\">\n<section id=\"elekt\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=en\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/elekt.jpg\" alt=\"Elekt\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">CARD GAME / 1–4 PLAYERS</span><h2>Elekt</h2><p>A tactical card game of competing for power. Summon servants, strengthen their abilities and seize influence.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Discover the game</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side elekt-expansions\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MORE ELEKT</span><h3>Elekt expansions</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=en#elekt-expansions\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/elekt-dodatki.png\" alt=\"Elekt expansions\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Elekt expansions</span></a><p>Expand your game and discover new combinations.</p><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=25&#038;lang=en#elekt-expansions\">Explore expansions</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"tsukuyumi\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature catalog-feature-box\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsukuyumi.png\" alt=\"Tsukuyumi: Full Moon Down\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">STRATEGY / ASYMMETRIC FACTIONS</span><h2>Tsukuyumi</h2><p>Choose an army in a world after the moon fell. Each faction fights differently — your decisions determine the outcome.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Discover the game</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXPAND YOUR WORLD</span><h3>Sunrise Kingdom</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en#tsu-sunrise\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsu-Tsukuyumi-SunriseKingdom-300x285.jpg\" alt=\"Sunrise Kingdom\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><p>Five new factions, Gates and Gifts of Amaterasu. A major expansion for Full Moon Down.</p><div class=\"catalog-related\"><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en#tsu-factions\">All factions</a><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en#tsu-expansions\">New Lands and Player+</a></div><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en#tsu-sunrise\">Explore expansions</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"kurzolaki\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=en\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/kurzolaki.jpg\" alt=\"Dustlings\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">BOARD GAME</span><h2>Dustlings</h2><p>Dustlings, Bugs and a bar of soap battle beneath the bed. Each side has its own abilities and goal.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Discover the game</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DUSTLINGS EXPANSION</span><h3>Sweet Revenge</h3><a class=\"expansion-art\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=en#dust-expansion\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/kurzolaki-sweet-revenge.jpg\" alt=\"Sweet Revenge\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><p>Take the Candy’s side. Command Crumbs and Gummies — this sweet prize can fight back.</p><a class=\"catalog-cta expansions-button\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=91&#038;lang=en#dust-expansion\">Explore expansions</a></aside></section>\n<section id=\"klanarchia\" class=\"catalog-world world-elekt\"><a class=\"catalog-feature\" href=\"https://whatthefrog.pl/klanarchia/\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/klanarchia.jpg\" alt=\"Clanarchy\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">ROLEPLAYING GAME</span><h2>Clanarchy</h2><p>Tell your own story in a world of dark techno-mysticism.</p><span class=\"catalog-cta\">Discover the game</span></div></a><aside class=\"catalog-side catalog-side-empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></aside></section>\n<section id=\"publications\" class=\"catalog-publications\"><header><span class=\"eyebrow\">PUBLICATIONS</span><h2>Worlds beyond the board.</h2><p>Artwork, stories and music. Another way to immerse yourself in imagination.</p></header><article id=\"catalog-echo\" class=\"publication publication-echo\"><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=en\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Echo-Swiatow-2.jpg\" alt=\"Artbook Echo Światów i płyta CD\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"publication-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ARTBOOK + CD</span><h3><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=en\">Echo Światów</a></h3><p>An album of illustrations and music composed for its images, with stories and inspiration for RPG sessions. Listen, look and create stories of your own.</p><label class=\"catalog-audio-label\" for=\"catalog-echo-audio\">Listen: Witches</label><audio id=\"catalog-echo-audio\" controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/echo-Elekt-Witches.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio><a class=\"catalog-cta\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=227&#038;lang=en\">Discover the album</a></div></article><a id=\"catalog-comic\" class=\"publication publication-comic\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/?page_id=188&#038;lang=en\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/media/tsukuyumi-komiks.png\" alt=\"Tsukuyumi comic\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">COMIC</span><h3>Tsukuyumi</h3><p>The story of Earth’s downfall and its factions.</p></a></section>\n</div></main>"
